<title>USA: Hector Communications Corp Q1 net off.</title>
<headline>Hector Communications Corp Q1 net off.</headline>
<dateline>HECTOR, Minn. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.06		    $0.22</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.06		     0.19</p>
<p> Net			    131			494</p>
<p> Revs			 6,882		    1,666</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,278		    2,256</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 operating income was $1.98 million versus $372,444 in Q1 1996. Q1 1997 oper includes Alliance Telecommunications Corp, a venture in which Hector holds 68 percent, which acquired Ollig Utilities Co in April 1996.</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1996 includes pre-tax gains of $688,000 on sales of marketable securities.</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 includes interest expense of $1.58 million versus $271,082 in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
